  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have a lot of friends and would love to see pop-ups of just my favorite friends go online.  So, rather having a pop-up for every user logged in, I can choose which favorite list(s) to receive notifications.  On the left side below the number of mails and option to turn on 🔔 Push, when the Push option is turned on a new menu appears at the bottom.  In this menu will be 4 checkmark options.  With the header \"Show Notifications:\" the options are: all, favorites 1, favorites 2, favorites 3 (replaced with the custom name the user set).  When the user clicks All, the checkmark will appear and also turn on the rest of them.  But if it is turned off, only that option gets turned off.  The rest of the options can be clicked on/off individually regardless.  By default, all of them will be on (checkmarked).",
